{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632220/extras/hearts3.png?t=1752834903\" /></div><strong>MEET NICOLE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zodiac: Aquarius</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Preferences: Sexual role-play, anal sex, double penetration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nicole is a closed book, the kind who keeps her cards close to her chest. She's as tough as nails, with a sharp wit that cuts as deep as her blade. Trust doesn\u2019t come easily to her, and she has a hard time connecting with others. Most of the time, she merely uses people \u2014 emotionally, physically, and even sexually. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632220/extras/down_bar_small.png?t=1752834903\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632220/extras/hearts3.png?t=1752834903\" /></div><strong>WHAT YOU'RE GETTING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From now on, Nicole will not only be your trusted companion but also your inspiring muse! She will accompany you on the main screen with dynamic animations and intriguing dialogues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By purchasing this DLC, you'll get Nicole as a mascot. You can switch mascots anytime by opening your profile and selecting the &quot;Mascots&quot; tab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, you'll receive 5000 credits and 150 super serum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most importantly, you'll have our eternal gratitude! Thank you for considering purchasing this DLC!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3632220?t=1752834903","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/s